00113811826000005/cbre-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CBRE is the world's largest commercial real estate services and investments firm (based on 2025 revenue). We derive competitive advantage from our considerable scale and ability to offer integrated solutions for real estate investors and occupiers in more than 100 countries. We are global market leaders in most of our business lines and drive significant growth by helping clients optimize real estate costs, value, investment returns and workplace experiences. These capabilities, combined with our extensive knowledge platform (research, data, strategy, etc.), allow us to generate superior outcomes for our clients, which included nearly 90% of Fortune 100 companies and many of the world's largest institutional real estate investors in 2025.","zh":""},{"en":"Our growth opportunity is enhanced by the large and expanding total addressable market for our services. We are focused on cementing our leadership position in each of our businesses with a strategy that achieves growth across four dimensions of our business: geographies, clients, property types and services. We are committed to deploying our resources and capital in parts of our business that benefit from secular tailwinds and/or are cyclically resilient across these four dimensions. Examples of how we have expanded our participation in secularly favored and resilient businesses and enlarged our total addressable market include our acquisitions of:","zh":""},{"en":"J&J Worldwide Services (now doing business as CBRE Government & Defense Services), which markedly increased the facilities-related services we provide to the U.S. federal government;","zh":""}],"markets":[{"en":"We serve clients and report our financial results through four business segments: Advisory Services, Building Operations & Experience, Project Management and Real Estate Investments. We also report results for a Corporate and other segment, which encompasses our platform and non-core investments.","zh":""},{"en":"Advisory Services provides a comprehensive range of services globally, including leasing, capital markets (property sales and mortgage origination), loan servicing, and valuation. With a global network of experts that have a deep understanding of their local markets, we offer comprehensive insights and solutions across a wide range of assets, including offices, industrial and logistics, retail, multi-family and critical facilities, such as data centers, laboratories, and government facilities. Our client base is comprised of large occupiers and investors that contract for our services across multi-market portfolios as well as local market clients that we serve on a one-off basis.","zh":""}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Building Operations Experience","val":23224000000,"zh":"Building Operations Experience"},{"name":"Advisory Services","val":8840000000,"zh":"Advisory Services"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"Project Management"},{"name":"Real Estate Investments","val":879000000,"zh":"Real Estate Investments"}],"total":40550000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Facilities Management","val":20645000000,"zh":"設施管理"},{"name":"Project Management","val":7657000000,"zh":"專案管理"},{"name":"Advisory Leasing","val":4497000000,"zh":"Advisory Leasing"},{"name":"Property Management","val":2529000000,"zh":"物業管理"},{"name":"Advisory Sales","val":2120000000,"zh":"諮詢銷售"},{"name":"Valuation","val":815000000,"zh":"估價"},{"name":"Investment Management Property Management Brokerage & Other Professional Services","val":602000000,"zh":"投資管理 物業管理 經紀及其他專業服務"},{"name":"Bank Servicing","val":357000000,"zh":"銀行服務"},{"name":"Other Portfolio Services","val":354000000,"zh":"其他組合服務"},{"name":"Real Estate Development Services","val":266000000,"zh":"房地產開發服務"}],"total":40550000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":22848000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"All Other Countries","val":11993000000,"zh":"所有其他國家"},{"name":"GB","val":5709000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":40550000000}},"peers":["JLL","ALLE","FTV","IQV","REG"]}}